{"seq":1,"slug":"early-life-and-struggle","title":"早年与磨难","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/kazuo-inamori/life-and-times/early-life-and-struggle","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"childhood-and-setbacks","title":"童年与挫折","url":"/c/people/kazuo-inamori/life-and-times/early-life-and-struggle/childhood-and-setbacks","wordCount":1960,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"finding-purpose-in-work","title":"在工作中找到使命","url":"/c/people/kazuo-inamori/life-and-times/early-life-and-struggle/finding-purpose-in-work","wordCount":1844,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 早年与磨难\n\n本章讲述稻盛和夫早年的磨难与觉醒。贫困、疾病与学业的失败，构成了稻盛和夫早年的底色；而正是这些磨难，磨砺了他坚韧的意志。在松风工业，稻盛和夫经历了从抱怨到全身心投入的转变，在工作中找到了人生的使命。两篇文档，分别呈现他童年的挫折，以及在工作中找到使命的觉醒。\n"}